00:38.620 --> 00:41.080
Even if I had my erased memories back

00:38.620 --> 00:41.080
Kesareta kioku ni sae mo

00:41.210 --> 00:43.670
I wouldn't remember the two of us

00:41.210 --> 00:43.670
futari no omoide nai

00:43.920 --> 00:48.590
That's my one-sided and self-destructive love

00:43.920 --> 00:48.590
Sou wansaido jibaku no aisa

00:49.590 --> 00:51.550
I am still young

00:49.590 --> 00:51.550
Atara wakai

00:51.720 --> 00:55.010
but willing to exchange my life for yours

00:51.720 --> 00:55.010
Inochi o hikikaeshita tote kamawanai

00:56.180 --> 00:57.810
I'll become

00:56.180 --> 00:57.810
Kimi no

00:58.390 --> 01:00.060
your hero

00:58.390 --> 01:00.060
hiiroo ni naru

01:00.350 --> 01:02.640
If you are

01:00.350 --> 01:02.640
kimi ga akutou de

01:02.850 --> 01:07.020
kidnapped by villains

01:02.850 --> 01:07.020
saratte kureta nara

01:07.400 --> 01:11.440
You can upgrade me as you please

01:07.400 --> 01:11.440
katte ni kaizou shite mo ii ze

01:11.860 --> 01:15.450
Katte Ni

01:11.860 --> 01:15.450
Kaizou

01:11.860 --> 01:15.450
[Elesa-Suimasen] presents

01:15.870 --> 01:20.700
Second year student of Torauma High School, Katsu Kaizō is a cyborg.

01:20.700 --> 01:24.460
Attacked by mysterious people and left close to death with severe injuries

01:24.460 --> 01:27.590
he was turned into a cyborg by genius scientist Saien Suzu

01:27.590 --> 01:29.880
which saved his life.

01:29.880 --> 01:32.260
She brought along with her the underling Tsubouchi Chitan

01:32.260 --> 01:35.050
along with whom Kaizō continues his fight.

01:36.010 --> 01:39.510
Or at least, this is what he imagines.

01:49.020 --> 01:51.860
Kaizō, get up already!

01:54.180 --> 01:56.140
Isn't your big match today?!

01:56.640 --> 01:58.140
Fine, give me a break...

01:58.970 --> 02:00.300
I heard you already!

02:00.720 --> 02:03.560
My my, aren't you the devoted wife.

02:04.370 --> 02:05.560
It's not like that at all!

02:10.560 --> 02:13.460
Onee-chan, why are you hanging around in that kind of outfit again?!

02:13.730 --> 02:15.460
Don't be so stuffy.

02:18.270 --> 02:18.990
Pervert!

02:18.990 --> 02:23.680
Let me be clear on this. Me and Kaizō getting engaged was decided by our parents.

02:23.810 --> 02:25.750
I don't accept it, ok?

02:26.020 --> 02:27.460
That's my line!

02:27.630 --> 02:29.020
What was that?!

02:33.950 --> 02:35.230
I love you.

02:40.970 --> 02:42.230
There's just no way...

02:42.500 --> 02:43.600
We're not qualified for this.

02:44.110 --> 02:46.010
I was really just pulling a publicity stunt.

02:46.640 --> 02:48.450
So that was a publicity stunt?

02:49.270 --> 02:51.870
First of all, we're not really living under the same roof

02:51.870 --> 02:53.520
we're not engaged

02:53.520 --> 02:55.080
and needless to say I don't have a big match!

02:55.520 --> 02:58.960
Besides, not one millimeter of Torauma town faces the sea anywhere

02:59.580 --> 03:01.010
and there's no beautiful hill, either!

03:01.440 --> 03:07.080
Popularity
Keywords

03:01.440 --> 03:07.080
Bouncing Boobs

03:01.440 --> 03:07.080
Living Under One Roof

03:01.440 --> 03:07.080
Lots of Women

03:01.440 --> 03:07.080
Engagement

03:01.460 --> 03:04.160
There's no way I can become popular!

03:04.440 --> 03:07.080
Sorry for getting overly worked up!

03:07.440 --> 03:09.440
Why is it always like this?!

03:11.960 --> 03:14.270
Why don't you use me?

03:14.670 --> 03:16.640
Because I wanted to be popular!!

03:16.340 --> 03:19.340
Innocent World

03:26.830 --> 03:28.640
Redevelopment, huh?

03:28.640 --> 03:29.920
Is something wrong?

03:30.400 --> 03:31.220
Not really.

03:31.340 --> 03:34.040
There used to be an old shopping district around here.

03:34.380 --> 03:36.620
We used to play there a lot.

03:37.110 --> 03:39.490
Torauma Town in the late-50s/early-60s.

03:40.000 --> 03:42.870
This shopping district, which had developed out of a postwar black market

03:43.050 --> 03:44.870
was overflowing with life.

03:45.520 --> 03:47.870
All the new articles in the shop windows

03:48.260 --> 03:51.570
were a sign of Japan's economic growth.

03:52.590 --> 03:54.580
Oh, I wasn't born back then!

03:54.890 --> 03:58.940
We shouldn't try imitating a certain long-running police comic.

03:58.940 --> 04:00.790
They won't get it anyway.

04:01.050 --> 04:05.780
How about the story that came with the anniversary color page?

04:06.050 --> 04:09.180
Correction - back in, at most, the 90's...

04:09.210 --> 04:12.460
a children's playground was somewhere around here.

04:13.150 --> 04:14.840
How nostalgic!

04:15.010 --> 04:16.840
What games did you play?

04:16.840 --> 04:19.900
Oh, things like dodgeball or street baseball

04:19.980 --> 04:21.800
Some pretty dangerous stuff

04:21.800 --> 04:24.030
that our parents and teachers then told us not to do.

04:25.280 --> 04:26.160
Kaizō?

04:26.160 --> 04:28.910
Sneaky
Sneaky

04:29.330 --> 04:31.620
Very suspicious. That's clearly fishy behavior.

04:32.330 --> 04:33.660
Should we see what he's up to?

04:38.720 --> 04:39.750
Give the password.

04:40.320 --> 04:41.910
Scandinavian Beauties.

04:42.070 --> 04:42.720
Enter.

04:47.660 --> 04:48.610
Welcome!

04:48.860 --> 04:50.610
To the Club of Forbidden Games.

04:50.880 --> 04:52.890
<i>The Club of Forbidden Games? </i>

04:53.070 --> 04:54.770
As you all know

04:54.890 --> 04:57.580
this club is for the enjoyment of all the games

04:57.580 --> 05:00.570
banned by your parents or teachers when you were a child.

05:00.570 --> 05:01.740
Like "Ding-Dong-Ditch"!?

05:01.870 --> 05:02.610
Right!

05:02.770 --> 05:03.940
Or "Shiritori Samurai"?!

05:03.980 --> 05:04.960
That's right, that's right!

05:05.190 --> 05:06.340
Well, take it easy.

05:06.340 --> 05:08.810
We have a fridge in the waiting room...

05:09.980 --> 05:11.090
so feel free to use these.

05:13.000 --> 05:14.720
Ooh, scribbling on the fridge!

05:15.190 --> 05:17.250
That wasn't allowed! It wasn't allowed!

05:19.980 --> 05:22.840
Good, I see you're enjoying youself newbie!

05:23.980 --> 05:27.340
"Abacus Skating", right? That used to be banned as well!

05:27.400 --> 05:30.620
Yeah! I'd get smacked for doing it!

05:36.690 --> 05:39.190
Putting your fingers into an electric fan! That was banned!

05:39.360 --> 05:40.360
Ta da!

05:40.550 --> 05:41.700
Finger throw!

05:42.050 --> 05:44.360
That was banned! They'd say "Don't play with your food!"

05:44.840 --> 05:47.050
Well, then I'll use this tangerine net...

05:48.530 --> 05:49.780
That was banned!

05:49.780 --> 05:53.420
By the way, I'm wearing an apple one.

05:56.710 --> 05:58.000
That was banned!

05:59.280 --> 06:01.640
What's your forbidden game?

06:02.550 --> 06:03.140
It's this.

06:02.550 --> 06:03.140
14 Major Titles

06:02.550 --> 06:03.140
Circulation 20,000

06:02.550 --> 06:03.140
Weekly Shounen Jump

06:09.500 --> 06:10.750
In old issues of Jump

06:10.750 --> 06:14.010
women's bodies often had no nipples. So I would draw them in.

06:14.220 --> 06:17.570
It wasn't allowed, of course.

06:17.870 --> 06:20.010
That's definitely a unique game.

06:21.180 --> 06:23.940
I made some available for everybody tonight.

06:24.580 --> 06:27.790
They sell old Jump issues at Mandarake, so I brought some.

06:29.610 --> 06:30.890
• Playing "Save the Goldfish" at home.

06:29.610 --> 06:31.520
• Slipper Boomerang.

06:29.610 --> 06:32.070
• Playing "dead body" in the pool.

06:29.610 --> 06:32.580
• "Starting the Yamato" at the gas range.

06:29.610 --> 06:33.240
• Kneading a new eraser out of eraser crumbs.

06:29.610 --> 06:34.470
• Toilet paper tube races.

06:29.800 --> 06:34.640
Aside from those, the following forbidden games are available at this club:

06:29.960 --> 06:34.750
• Sticking your arm into a Chip Star box

06:30.500 --> 06:34.750
to have the ultimate gun.

06:31.070 --> 06:34.750
• Creating strobe light action

06:31.770 --> 06:34.750
by switching the lights on and off.

06:32.470 --> 06:34.750
• Putting an aluminum container in the

06:32.950 --> 06:34.750
microwave to simulate "Thundara".

06:33.520 --> 06:34.750
• Letting your cat eat toothpaste.

06:34.110 --> 06:34.750
• Using your umbrella handle to target people from behind

06:35.480 --> 06:36.740
But if you think about it carefully

06:36.880 --> 06:40.790
in our generation there aren't enough forbidden games anymore.

06:41.490 --> 06:45.050
How nice today's kids have it made! Everything's banned...

06:41.490 --> 06:47.920
Rotating Gyms

06:41.490 --> 06:47.920
Gulp

06:41.490 --> 06:47.920
Mobile Dating Sites

06:44.120 --> 06:47.920
Banned

06:45.390 --> 06:47.920
and the banned games are more fun.

06:47.920 --> 06:49.170
How stupid.

06:49.170 --> 06:51.470
Who are you!? When did you come in?

06:51.540 --> 06:54.190
I don't know anything about forbidden games

06:54.400 --> 06:57.160
but can't you play more normally?

06:58.160 --> 06:59.380
Wh...what are you talking about, Umi?

06:59.830 --> 07:00.670
As far as you're concerned...

07:00.940 --> 07:03.030
Every single game you play

07:03.330 --> 07:05.270
turns into a forbidden game, isn't that so?

07:06.730 --> 07:08.030
What do you mean by that?

07:08.850 --> 07:10.030
For example, playing "House"...

07:10.470 --> 07:14.510
I don't think that "House" would be a game you'd typically ban.

07:14.620 --> 07:15.690
How can I put this...

07:15.690 --> 07:17.660
When Umi does it, it's real!

07:19.420 --> 07:22.160
Okay, I'm the Mama, Kaizō-kun's the Papa.

07:22.340 --> 07:23.880
And Kayoko-san is the child, okay?

07:23.880 --> 07:24.630
Sure.

07:24.630 --> 07:25.670
Got it.

07:25.670 --> 07:28.590
Well then, Papa is going to work.

07:29.030 --> 07:29.960
Wait a second.

07:30.450 --> 07:32.890
Kayoko-san's Papa doesn't go to work.

07:33.160 --> 07:37.560
He always goes to the park, sits on a swing and then comes home in the afternoon.

07:38.950 --> 07:41.020
So you go to the park, too, Papa.

07:42.770 --> 07:43.720
I'm home.

07:44.010 --> 07:47.030
Today, I counted doves in the park again.

07:49.530 --> 07:52.760
A new dad made his park debut today.

07:55.970 --> 07:57.630
Why won't you say anything?

07:57.780 --> 07:59.710
Because that's not real, is it?

08:00.020 --> 08:02.760
Kayoko-san's Papa and Mama don't talk to each other!

08:04.620 --> 08:06.480
Will you please stop talking about our family!

08:06.480 --> 08:08.670
Oh, it's Kayoko-san's Mama!

08:08.880 --> 08:09.860
That's what it was like.

08:10.320 --> 08:12.230
I guess you would ban that, wouldn't you...

08:12.230 --> 08:13.160
After that...

08:13.690 --> 08:15.840
Playing "Cops and Robbers" was banned as well.

08:15.840 --> 08:19.830
"Cops and Robbers"? But isn't that actually a pretty typical game?

08:20.700 --> 08:22.380
But this is for real.

08:25.010 --> 08:26.360
You're under arrest!

08:28.400 --> 08:29.200
Spit it out!

08:29.480 --> 08:35.020
Interrogation Room

08:29.530 --> 08:32.030
How much does your father earn per year?!

08:32.030 --> 08:35.060
Who's your mother having an affair with?

08:35.830 --> 08:38.800
If she arrests you, you'll be subjected to relentless interrogation.

08:40.740 --> 08:43.730
Later, playing "Doctor" was forbidden, too.

08:43.930 --> 08:47.160
Well, I suppose that's something you might ban...

08:50.310 --> 08:53.090
It's an imitation of a doctor during surgery.

08:54.840 --> 08:58.350
I... I don't play forbidden games that much!

08:58.500 --> 08:59.290
Speaking of which...

08:59.930 --> 09:02.820
Weren't you a forbidden game yourself, Umi?

09:04.660 --> 09:06.520
Don't play with that girl.

09:09.150 --> 09:11.220
Back then, most of the kids in our neighborhood

09:11.220 --> 09:13.490
were banned from playing with Umi!

09:11.400 --> 09:13.300
Banned

09:14.940 --> 09:17.040
She's ... way too banned.

09:20.580 --> 09:23.340
W-what's with that disturbing look...?

09:23.690 --> 09:27.610
Let's offer her a forbidden game before this gets serious!

09:27.760 --> 09:30.630
We beg you, please accept this doll to play with!

09:32.590 --> 09:36.620
Of course! Speaking of games usually banned for girls

09:36.630 --> 09:39.890
there's cutting your doll's hair!

09:39.890 --> 09:42.210
That's... Even <i>more  </i>banned!

09:49.120 --> 09:51.010
She's been cutting for quite some time, hasn't she?

10:00.370 --> 10:03.020
