I'm searching for what's missing from my heart.

13:59.250 --> 14:00.400
One moment, please.

14:00.400 --> 14:02.730
I'm finishing the previous engagements first.

14:02.900 --> 14:07.220
I've outlived my wife and haven't laughed in years.

14:07.520 --> 14:11.200
That's why I'm searching for the part of my
heart that can make me feel happy.

14:11.390 --> 14:14.380
I'm very sorry, but your dead wife won't come back.

14:14.800 --> 14:16.380
I know that.

14:17.330 --> 14:20.710
But you can use something else to fill in the missing part.

14:28.290 --> 14:30.000
Y- You're...

14:30.000 --> 14:31.310
Father.

14:33.220 --> 14:37.430
Can't you finally accept our relationship ... Father?

14:38.110 --> 14:39.510
Don't tell me... this boy is...

14:39.890 --> 14:42.120
This is your grandson, Takeshi.

14:42.390 --> 14:43.980
Grandson...!

14:50.180 --> 14:56.410
That's right. People can replace the things they're missing with something new.

14:57.120 --> 14:59.670
Well,  some people use things that are inappropriate...

15:00.070 --> 15:01.040
That being so...

15:01.580 --> 15:05.100
You should go looking for something new as well.

15:09.300 --> 15:10.550
".......-kun."

15:12.120 --> 15:16.610
Ever since that happened, you've been shutting in your loving heart.

15:17.290 --> 15:19.390
But, even if you start looking for something new to fill your heart

15:19.390 --> 15:23.690
without a companion, it won't mean anything.

15:28.330 --> 15:30.000
<i>The new thing...</i>

15:30.220 --> 15:32.000
<i>probably isn't Kaizō-kun.</i>

15:33.490 --> 15:35.490
Torauma Private
High School

15:35.700 --> 15:38.930
I'm actually going on a journey to find something I've lost.

15:39.460 --> 15:43.820
I'll going try my best to find out how it feels to fall in love with somebody.

15:44.230 --> 15:48.580
But Yamada-san, weren't you going out with Kaizō-kun?

15:48.580 --> 15:50.870
Weren't you in love with Kaizō-kun?

15:51.140 --> 15:54.970
He gave me some nice stuff , which made me think it was the real thing

15:54.970 --> 15:56.560
but I was wrong.

15:58.270 --> 16:00.260
Don't say "She's a schoolgirl prostitute!"

16:00.480 --> 16:01.510
I'm not saying anything!

16:02.540 --> 16:05.260
So, that guy Kaizō got dumped by Yamada?

16:06.110 --> 16:09.530
<i>Umi-chan ... has the part that I'm missing.</i>

16:09.810 --> 16:12.220
<i>Now Kaizō-kun can be all mine!</i>

16:14.770 --> 16:16.570
<i>Now he'll be all mine!</i>

16:16.570 --> 16:18.740
<i>They all ... have that piece in their hearts.</i>

16:19.300 --> 16:22.300
<i>And Kaizō-kun is using more than one piece there... </i>

16:24.790 --> 16:27.770
Well everyone, thanks for putting up with me till now.

16:27.960 --> 16:29.470
Wait a minute!

16:29.550 --> 16:33.600
You could at least finally tell us your full name, which you've been hiding all this time!

16:35.010 --> 16:35.600
Name?

16:37.260 --> 16:38.600
My name is...

16:39.600 --> 16:40.600
Yamada...

16:46.000 --> 16:48.730
Give me a break! That's not a name!!

16:49.010 --> 16:51.530
That's really as much as I know now.

16:51.740 --> 16:53.740
She's actually giving it to you straight.

16:53.910 --> 16:54.720
Chief!

16:54.970 --> 16:58.820
Yamada-san suffers from a rare disease that, bit by bit, causes her name

16:59.060 --> 17:00.470
to be eaten.

17:00.660 --> 17:01.470
Say what?!

17:01.790 --> 17:03.500
So now...

17:03.990 --> 17:04.580
is all that's left.

17:04.890 --> 17:07.090
It could have been Michiyo, or Haruka

17:07.810 --> 17:10.030
or maybe even Ryōko!

17:10.690 --> 17:12.700
And soon, the will vanish as well...

17:13.430 --> 17:15.470
This sickness is famous for afflicting the Artist Formerly Known As Prince

17:15.470 --> 17:20.720
Wakato Akira  and Lalah Sune's personal Mobile Armor.

17:20.800 --> 17:21.440
Umi!

17:21.790 --> 17:22.810
Give her one of yours!

17:22.950 --> 17:25.200
