17:26.990 --> 17:29.110
Jko-san

17:27.100 --> 17:29.110
Mabuchi

17:27.250 --> 17:29.110
Tamakawa-san

17:27.590 --> 17:29.110
KoGlay-san

17:27.590 --> 17:29.110
Chikuro-chan

