17:39.500 --> 17:40.920
I've never even been there!!

17:45.710 --> 17:47.460
<i>Yes... if I...</i>

17:48.050 --> 17:49.830
<i>don't have a heart, I won't have a name.</i>

17:50.330 --> 17:52.590
<i>There are many things I'm lacking.</i>

17:53.020 --> 17:56.660
<i>which means I'll eventually vanish from everyone's memories, too...</i>

18:02.910 --> 18:09.510
<i>But, I feel that if I can restore my heart...
I can surely restore my name...</i>

18:10.420 --> 18:11.980
Until then...

18:11.980 --> 18:13.270
